			"notes": "**MineGlot 1.0.3** introduces a system that notifies players when a new stable version is available.\n\n**Important:** MineGlot 1.0.3 must be installed manually. Once installed, the mod can notify players when later versions become available. MineGlot never replaces its own JAR automatically.\n\n### What's new and fixed\n\n- Update notification on the main menu.\n- Update notification in the chat after joining a multiplayer server.\n- Download choices for GitHub, CurseForge, and Modrinth.\n- All update links open only the official MineGlot pages.\n- A Later button allows players to dismiss the main-menu notification.\n- Updated supported Claude models.\n- Hardened `/trs msg`: an unknown player no longer causes the message to be sent publicly.\n- Clickable links and commands are preserved during chat translation.\n\n### Installation\n\n1. Fully close Minecraft.\n2. Remove the previous MineGlot JAR from the `mods` folder.\n3. Place `MineGlot-1.0.3.jar` in the `mods` folder.\n4. Make sure only one MineGlot JAR is installed.\n5. Relaunch Minecraft 1.8.9 with Forge.\n\n### Official download pages\n\n- GitHub: https://github.com/NtGitG/minecraft-ai-translator/releases\n- CurseForge: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mineglot\n- Modrinth: https://modrinth.com/mod/mineglot/versions\n\nSHA-256: `c52d61fb65be12694f1fb7c026b2d6e90ebde70e77122d7dcdb9995cdd5d7e67`"
